{
  "name": "Umbral Strikes",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn the following new ways to use your Sneak Attack:</p><ul><li><strong>Curse (Cost: 1d6).</strong> The target has to make a Charisma Saving Throw or be cursed until the end of your next turn. For the duration of the effect, the target must roll a d4 every time it rolls an Attack Roll or Saving Throw and subtract the result from the total.</li><li><strong>Enfeeble (Cost: 2d6).</strong> The target has to make a Constitution Saving Throw or deal half damage with weapon attacks until the end of your next turn.</li></ul><p>Additionally, while you are in darkness, you can reduce the cost of any feature that uses your Sneak Attack dice by 2 instead of 1 (to a minimum of 0). You can do so only once per turn.</p>",
